A towering digital forest of glowing blue directory trees with twisted, tangled branches, rendered in the style of Vincent van Gogh with swirling, expressive brushstrokes in deep blues, teals, and golden yellows. The trees have crystalline nodes pulsing with data streams, their roots interweaving chaotically underground in a maze of competing pathways. One massive ancient tree dominates the center with traditional bark texture, while younger saplings nearby shimmer with cloud-like ethereal forms, slightly translucent and glitching at the edges. The night sky above churns with van Gogh's signature spiral patterns, but the stars are tiny encrypted key symbols and JSON bracket shapes woven naturally into the cosmic swirls. Fireflies made of small glowing tokens drift between the mismatched trees, some unable to pass through certain branches, bouncing off invisible barriers. The overall mood conveys beautiful complexity masking underlying chaos and incompatibility.
